    },
    {
      "start": 46.22,
      "end": 51.64,
      "text": "they talk in numbers quiet and precise like certainty is something you can slice"
    },
    {
      "start": 51.64,
      "end": 55.42,
      "text": "but every measure i align feels like it fractures over time"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.42,
      "end": 62.68,
      "text": "not quite stable not quite mine somewhere near a boundary line"
    },
    {
      "start": 62.68,
