    },
    {
      "start": 173.62,
      "end": 179.56,
      "text": "i'd stop being fine but what happens to everything i carried here"
    },
    {
      "start": 179.78,
      "end": 186.16,
      "text": "all the small lights compressed into fear does it disappear or ignite"
    },
    {
      "start": 187.74,
      "end": 193.4,
      "text": "i start to feel the edges strain the quiet shift beneath the name"
    },
    {
      "start": 193.4,
      "end": 199.48,
      "text": "no single self can hold the weight of every doubt i fabricate"
    },
    {
      "start": 199.48,
      "end": 204.76,
      "text": "and maybe breaking isn't loss but just a different kind of cost"
    },
    {
      "start": 204.76,
